      "description": "B2, M1, E3: a Git tree (git ls-tree -r -t). Member bytes are the blob bytes; checkout_text shows what core.autocrlf=true would write on checkout, which is ignored. Mode 100755 is an ordinary member. Tree entries (040000) are not members.",
      "entries": [
        {
          "path": ".project.json",
          "mode": "100644",
          "text": "{\"name\": \"p\", \"version\": \"1.0.0\"}\n"
